4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RxvorShmv6IQ7kNvwG-ubUW&_nc_oc=AdoN4XmiuzGJSL9vKMBrhZgMnXJEdJ2OmCDRbhZKlZXvCA0j5I8Ibm7aKn9zDpHF38Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwIoGu6iRH1R26fq2ILf4yQNprj7ci_HqoLGxJ1NEG6qg&oe=69CBC654"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zDTkd48ysz0Q7kNvwGRdLm3&_nc_oc=AdqNDUmX2ZvdIMxmseXf7A4NwsZJdPO_i0HnuzGT7x_Z4STIJoN-RrS-qUPBYQIKNbU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfzAbtHcY3NPRbW1jieEgkngCM_2TCPiw_xKCiNIf6J12Q&oe=69CBCB32"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ihh-D9z-Jq0Q7kNvwHnBMWk&_nc_oc=Adqa4p9t1kkALQZMRQVmLvI4J0xG5_1ylFAtqMXkaxGcXrT7E2t3vBy5F2D1y4N4taI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyhpTat0VfejYsRiAkoQcV-6xNEVq5fpAgFH4Nrh29bEg&oe=69CBD8D5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p